       Q: The compiled priority list contains only 'HumanWellbeing', but the raw intent ranks value_per_resource_consumed first. Once the fatigue (≤ 0.4) and noise (≤ 80 dB) hard constraints are satisfied, should the scheduler then maximise value_per_resource_consumed as a primary objective, or are all three KPIs to be weighted equally within the feasible region?
