    1. delivered_value_per_resource_consumed / assumptions.resource_scope
       Q: How should energy, raw materials, labor-hours, and machine time be combined into a single resource-consumption denominator — specifically, what cost or CO2-equivalent weighting applies to each resource type — because if weights are unspecified the optimiser will likely minimise whichever resource is cheapest while over-consuming others (e.g., substituting 40% more energy for labor)?
